{"title":"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 39","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is the smallest positive integer that when raised to the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/8/3f824e6daa3781872a692e71838a60255a1e5447.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^{th}$\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" /> power, it can be represented by a sum of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/8/3f824e6daa3781872a692e71838a60255a1e5447.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6^{th}$\" width=\"21\" height=\"15\" /> powers of distinct smaller positive integers?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The smallest such integer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/6/66644fd9f411299c3c1eabf151b5f601c9ef6c21.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. It can be represented as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/d/c/0dce445132325b49504403b3ad00606233860104.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^6+2^6+3^6+5^6+6^6+7^6+8^6+9^6+10^6+12^6+13^6+15^6+16^6+17^6+18^6+23^6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"673\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_39&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest\" title=\"2005 iTest\">2005 iTest</a> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems\">(Problems</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 iTest Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key)</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_38&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 38 (page does not exist)\">Problem 38</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by:<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_40\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 40\">Problem 40</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_iTest_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2005 iTest Problems/P